abstract: >-
  Paper 3 of 3 of the Validated-by-Design series:
  A Shift-Left Approach to Computer System Validation for Cloud-Native
  GxP Platforms. This paper provides regulatory and implementation guidance
  for applying the Validated-by-Design approach to cloud-native GxP platforms,
  with a focus on practical implementation and continuous assurance.

